---
import Layout from "../layouts/PostLayout.astro";
import githubIcon from "pixelarticons/svg/github.svg?raw";
import mailIcon from "pixelarticons/svg/mail.svg?raw";
---

<Layout
	title="whoami?"
	description="Who's on the other side."
	pubDate={new Date("June 22 2026")}
>
	<p>Hi, I'm Julian, a backend developer (most of the time).</p>
	<pre><code><span class="prompt">[julian@artixlinux </span>~<span class="prompt">]$</span> cat stack.txt
- web apps:      astro, react, next.js, sveltekit
- backend:       java, python, pytorch, postgresql, prisma
- audio:         c++, juce, rust
- desktop/mobile: electron, react native
- infra/devops:  docker, nginx, aws, github actions
	</code></pre>

	<div class="contact-section">
	<h3 class="contact-heading">Contact</h3>

	<ul class="contacts">
		<li>
			<span class="icon" set:html={githubIcon} />
			<span class="label">github</span>
			<a href="https://github.com/julianZ99">github.com/julianZ99</a>
		</li>
		<li>
			<span class="icon" set:html={mailIcon} />
			<span class="label">email</span>
			<a href="mailto:julianZ99@proton.me">julianZ99@proton.me</a>
		</li>
	</ul>
</div>
</Layout>
